 <HI REND="ITALIC">Quanto mens nostra,</HI>  etc. Ibid. col. 641.</P> <P COM="0189"><COL N="0189C"></COL> CCXII. Germano illustrissimo.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Excubantibus vobis,</HI> 
