In Vallic. hic episcopus desideratur.</NOTE>  Comensis.</ITEM></LIST> <LIST COM="0385"><HEAD COM="0385"><NOTE N="j" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0385" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0385D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Daciae</HI>  supplevimus ex nostris codd.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">Daciae.</HI></HEAD> <ITEM><COL N="0385B"></COL> Protogenes Sardicae.</ITEM></LIST> <LIST COM="0385"><HEAD COM="0385"><HI REND="ITALIC">Mysiae.</HI></HEAD> <ITEM>Pistus Martianopolitanus.</ITEM> <ITEM><NOTE N="k" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0385" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0385D"></COL> Duos quoque sequentes episcopos addidimus
