conciliorum XCVIII, CIII, CV, 650  <HI REND="ITALIC">not.</HI>  651  <HI REND="ITALIC">not.</HI>  Aliquando
in repetitione quaedam voces mutatae vel additae, 649
 <HI REND="ITALIC">not.,</HI>  650  <HI REND="ITALIC">not.,</HI>  651  <HI REND="ITALIC">not.,</HI>  652  <HI REND="ITALIC">not.</HI></ITEM> <ITEM>Africanum concilium contra Pelagianos sub Zosimo celebratum.
 <HI REND="ITALIC">Vid.</HI>  Pelagiani.</ITEM> <ITEM>Aganus episcopus Heduensis, CXCVI.</ITEM> <ITEM>Agapes, 125, 438.</ITEM> <ITEM>Agathensis synodi canones vulgati post canonem quadragesimum
